 The option's names are `-t` and `--times`. More names are available for options and are covered in {ref}`options`.
 
+Click also has a {attr}`~click.Parameter.spec` for each parameter, which is how the user spells it on the command line. For the option it is `--times`, the name with the longest prefix, and for the argument it is `FILENAME`, its metavar or its upper-cased name. Messages such as the warning for a deprecated parameter name it by its `spec`. An option declared as `--color/--no-color` has the `spec` `--color`.
